Package: yamaa
Title: Clinical Data Specifications with the Shared Rust Engine
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Ming-Chun", "Chen", email = "hellomingchun@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds a bounded set of clinical data specifications through the
    shared Rust engine and returns owned data frames and structured issues.
    Includes native qualification interfaces while full migration coverage,
    environment activation and release API consolidation remain in progress.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.6.1)
SystemRequirements: Cargo, rustc (>= 1.90.0), GNU make
NeedsCompilation: yes
